sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Evidence Source
  participant G as Ingestion Gateway
  participant C as Evidence Catalog
  participant R as Risk and Control Service
  participant H as Human Decision Authority
  S->>G: Signed evidence package or event
  G->>G: Authenticate, validate, mark, check replay
  alt valid
    G->>C: Register evidence and provenance
    C->>R: Evidence accepted or superseded
    R->>R: Recalculate coverage, confidence, and risk
    R->>H: Present impacts, gaps, and alternatives
    H->>R: Record decision and revisit conditions
  else invalid
    G->>C: Quarantine metadata and reason
    C-->>S: Corrective action request
  end
